TITLE Equilibrate 100C Ca solution with calcite/gypsum/aragonite and fixed gas partial pressures
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite   0  10
    Aragonite 0  10
    Gypsum    0  10

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -temperature 25
    CO2(g) 1
    CH4(g) 5
    H2S(g) 10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings pe
    10 PUNCH PE
END
